1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,405
I erase people's voices

2
00:00:01,425 --> 00:00:02,720
for a living.

3
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:03,177
Voicemail,

4
00:00:03,197 --> 00:00:04,310
I mean.

5
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:05,005
When a mailbox

6
00:00:05,025 --> 00:00:05,555
fills up,

7
00:00:05,575 --> 00:00:06,900
I wipe it.

8
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,640
Three hundred a day.

9
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:09,560
We're never allowed

10
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,885
to listen.

11
00:00:11,065 --> 00:00:11,895
Last winter,

12
00:00:11,915 --> 00:00:12,683
one box wouldn't

13
00:00:12,703 --> 00:00:14,115
stop filling.

14
00:00:14,155 --> 00:00:15,360
Four hundred and twelve

15
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,705
messages.

16
00:00:16,745 --> 00:00:18,325
None of them heard.

17
00:00:18,505 --> 00:00:20,205
All from one number.

18
00:00:20,245 --> 00:00:21,238
Every Sunday.

19
00:00:21,258 --> 00:00:22,670
Six p.m.

20
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:23,915
Four hundred and twelve

21
00:00:23,935 --> 00:00:25,240
Sundays.

22
00:00:25,370 --> 00:00:26,287
The box belonged to

23
00:00:26,307 --> 00:00:28,045
a woman named June.

24
00:00:28,085 --> 00:00:28,865
June died eight

25
00:00:28,885 --> 00:00:30,110
years ago.

26
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:30,942
Someone still paid

27
00:00:30,962 --> 00:00:32,130
her bill.

28
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,427
Every message was nine

29
00:00:33,447 --> 00:00:34,910
seconds long.

30
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:35,880
Nobody says much in

31
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,405
nine seconds.

32
00:00:37,535 --> 00:00:38,340
I was supposed to

33
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,510
wipe it.

34
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:40,342
A wipe erases

35
00:00:40,362 --> 00:00:40,867
her greeting,

36
00:00:40,887 --> 00:00:41,930
too.

37
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:42,940
So I did something

38
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,640
I'm not allowed

39
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:44,790
to do.

40
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:46,500
I pressed play.

41
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:50,390
Hi, June. Just wanted to hear you.

42
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:51,820
He wasn't calling to

43
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,290
say anything.

44
00:00:53,330 --> 00:00:54,035
He was calling to

45
00:00:54,055 --> 00:00:55,285
hear this.

46
00:00:55,625 --> 00:00:58,525
Hi, it's June. Leave me something nice.

47
00:00:59,175 --> 00:00:59,955
Every Sunday,

48
00:00:59,975 --> 00:01:01,180
he did.

49
00:01:01,410 --> 00:01:02,015
Wipe it,

50
00:01:02,035 --> 00:01:02,915
and next Sunday he

51
00:01:02,935 --> 00:01:04,490
gets a stranger.

52
00:01:04,770 --> 00:01:05,650
You probably know a

53
00:01:05,670 --> 00:01:07,120
number like that.

54
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:07,927
One you'd call just

55
00:01:07,947 --> 00:01:09,390
to hear hello.

56
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,262
So I cleared

57
00:01:10,282 --> 00:01:11,800
his messages.

58
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:12,497
And I kept

59
00:01:12,517 --> 00:01:13,760
her voice.

60
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:18,400
Hi, it's June. Leave me something nice.

61
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:21,610
Just wanted to hear you.

